1
00:00:00,967 --> 00:00:02,787
In this lesson, you'll
add a coin to catch,

2
00:00:02,827 --> 00:00:03,927
and keep score.

3
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:06,000
The player moves with the arrow keys,

4
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:07,580
its blocks folded up here.

5
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:11,220
And there's a new sprite:
define sprite coin, still empty.

6
00:00:11,667 --> 00:00:15,607
First, from Program, drag create
sprite under create sprite player.

7
00:00:15,927 --> 00:00:18,827
Pick coin in its list,
and put it at 60, 60.

8
00:00:20,333 --> 00:00:23,793
From Looks, drag look like a
circle into define sprite coin.

9
00:00:24,073 --> 00:00:25,933
Make it size 14, and yellow.

10
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:30,740
From Motion, go to a random place
puts the coin somewhere new.

11
00:00:31,067 --> 00:00:33,307
Then, from Control, a forever loop,

12
00:00:33,347 --> 00:00:34,547
with an if inside it.

13
00:00:37,333 --> 00:00:40,013
From Sensing, touching
sprite goes in the if.

14
00:00:40,093 --> 00:00:41,453
Pick player in its list.

15
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:47,340
When the player touches the coin,

16
00:00:47,380 --> 00:00:49,660
from Variables, change score by 1.

17
00:00:50,033 --> 00:00:51,793
From Sound, play sound coin.

18
00:00:53,233 --> 00:00:55,913
And from Motion, go to
a random place again,

19
00:00:55,953 --> 00:00:57,713
so the coin jumps somewhere else.

20
00:00:58,067 --> 00:00:59,567
Last, show the score.

21
00:00:59,867 --> 00:01:02,767
From Control, a forever at the
end of when the game starts,

22
00:01:02,807 --> 00:01:05,047
with show variable score inside it.

23
00:01:05,367 --> 00:01:06,887
Press Run, click the game,

24
00:01:06,927 --> 00:01:08,347
and go and catch the coin.

25
00:01:08,733 --> 00:01:10,953
Every coin you catch
adds one to your score,

26
00:01:11,053 --> 00:01:12,393
and the coin jumps away.

27
00:01:13,333 --> 00:01:16,073
In the code, the coin
is a PROCESS of its own,

28
00:01:16,133 --> 00:01:18,113
and touching became a collision test.

29
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:19,060
Nice!

30
00:01:19,100 --> 00:01:22,220
In lesson four, you'll dodge
an enemy that bounces around.
